# OpenClaw Chat - Quick Reference
## Start Chat
```bash
bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat
```
## Options
```bash
--url <url>        # Gateway URL (default: ws://127.0.0.1:18789)
--token <token>    # Auth token (default: from config)
--session <key>    # Session name (default: main)
--model <model>    # AI model (default: from config)
--deliver          # Send to channels (default: false)
```
## Examples
```bash
# Basic
bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat
# Custom session
bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat --session work
# Different model
bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat --model google-antigravity/claude-opus-4-5-thinking
# With delivery
bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat --deliver
```
## In Chat
- Type message → Send to AI
- `exit` or `quit` → Leave chat
- `Ctrl+C` → Force quit
## Prerequisites
```bash
# Gateway must be running
bun scripts/run-node.mjs gateway
```
## Troubleshooting
```bash
# Check gateway
ps aux | grep gateway
# View logs
tail -f /tmp/openclaw/openclaw-*.log
# Check config
cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json
```
